<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 155 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 155 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were all out</p>
<p>for 155 in their first innings on the opening day of the first</p>
<p>test against Pakistan on Thursday.</p>
<p>Tea was taken at the end of New Zealand's innings.</p>
</text>
